{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["A Moment but Forever","In ancient times, Ji Tanyin, a mortal Yanshi, relied on her Heaven-Defying Mechanism ability to construct the Heaven and Earth Mechanism, and then rose to become a peerless goddess, maintaining the order of the Three Realms in the God Realm. However, the divine world was suddenly bathed in blood by the demons. Wushuang sacrificed her “God’s Heart” to create the ultimate artifact “God’s Hand” and wiped out the demons in one fell swoop. However, the “God’s Hand” was unexpectedly lost in the human realm. \n\n\n\nThe Heaven and Earth Mechanism stopped working, and the divine world withered away. Wushuang, who lost her “heart”, became a mortal maiden and descended to the human realm in search of God’s Hand. She counterattacked High Priest Youhu. After experiencing peerless love, she used the Heaven-Defying Mechanism to counterattack everyone. She eliminated the demons and resolved the disputes of the Three Realms in one fell swoop, saving the world and all living beings.\n\n\n\n(Source: iQIYI)"],"ja":["念无双",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-59433","ids":{"shikimori":59433,"mal":59433,"anilist":166418,"kodik":"serial-61184"},"kodikIds":["serial-61190","serial-61184"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-61190":"2024-10-24T05:30:21Z","serial-61184":"2024-08-13T18:37:38Z"},"title":"Вечность в моменте","originalTitle":"Nian Wu Shuang","alt":"A Moment but Forever / Nian Wushuang A Moment but Forever 念无双","description":"Богиня Бога-машины спустилась на землю, чтобы вернуть руку Господню, нарушила правила и изменила свою судьбу вопреки воле небес, пережила беспрецедентный любовный роман, добившись двойного успеха в карьере и любви. Давайте посмотрим, как героиня, получившая сценарий комикса \"вспыльчивый мальчик\", использует машинные навыки для контратак на всем пути, который увлекателен и полон смеха.","year":2024,"type":"ONA","genres":["Экшен","Фэнтези","Романтика","исторический"],"rating":6.79,"popul